- The filename MUST end in .test.ts (or .spec.ts) and follow the repo's existing test framework/conventions. NEVER write a test to a bare name like "test", and NEVER put a newline or space in the path.
- Assert the Verification Criteria above — the OBSERVABLE outcome (e.g. the return-trip discount value is present and correct), NOT the implementation mechanism.
